{%- comment -%}
  JP MART European Wholesale Hub v2 (dev): ONE smart B2B form (account application / quote / general), brands, terms, product-interest catalog.
  No prices rendered. Native Shopify contact form -> email to store contact address; customer record + tags are NOT verified until a live test.
  Add a language: add a when-branch below (same 67 strings, same order). Falls back to Polish.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'jpmart-b2b.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- case request.locale.iso_code -%}
  {%- when 'en' -%}
    {%- assign t = 'Apply for B2B account|Request a wholesale quote|Wholesale for businesses in Poland and across the EU|We welcome shops, pharmacies, salons, distributors and importers from Poland and other EU countries. One form – choose whether you want an account or a quote.|Brands we supply|Availability, prices and quantities are confirmed individually in your quote.|How it works|Shipped from our warehouse in Poland|We serve businesses in Poland and other EU countries|Net prices in EUR for approved business accounts|Quantities, availability and delivery cost are confirmed in your quote|How it works|Send your inquiry – company details and, optionally, the products you need|We verify your business details (EU VAT ID where applicable)|We reply with the next step: account approval, a quotation, or questions|You confirm the order and we issue the invoice with VAT applied correctly|Terms at a glance|Prices|Net wholesale price list in EUR for approved business customers|Quantities|Depend on the product and are confirmed in your quote|Delivery|Cost depends on the destination country and order details|VAT and invoice|Depend on applicable rules and verified transaction conditions|Availability|Confirmed in your quote|Product-interest catalog|Search products and add the ones you want quoted. No prices are shown here. Product not listed? Describe it in your message.|Search product or brand…|All brands|Add to quote|Qty|No products found.|Selected products|No products selected yet.|Remove|Clear all|B2B inquiry|Fill in the short form. We will only ask for further details (e.g. invoice address) when needed.|Inquiry type|Apply for wholesale account|Wholesale quote|Other question|Company name|Business email|Country|Select country|Contact person|Phone|EU VAT ID|Website|Message (including products not listed above)|I have read the|privacy policy.|Your details are used to answer this inquiry. Sending this form is not marketing consent.|Send inquiry|Sending…|Thank you! We received your inquiry and will reply to the email you provided.|Fields marked * are required.|Select products or describe what you need.|Looking for retail prices? Visit our retail store.|Go to retail store|Reference: JP MART wholesale price list 30.09.2026. Prices are shared only with approved business customers.|Enter a valid email address.|Please fill in this field.|Please confirm to send your inquiry.' | split: '|' -%}
  {%- when 'de' -%}
    {%- assign t = 'B2B-Konto beantragen|Großhandelsangebot anfragen|Großhandel für Unternehmen in Polen und der gesamten EU|Wir freuen uns über Geschäfte, Apotheken, Salons, Händler und Importeure aus Polen und anderen EU-Ländern. Ein Formular – wählen Sie, ob Sie ein Konto oder ein Angebot möchten.|Unsere Marken|Verfügbarkeit, Preise und Mengen bestätigen wir individuell im Angebot.|So funktioniert es|Versand aus unserem Lager in Polen|Wir beliefern Unternehmen in Polen und anderen EU-Ländern|Netto-Preise in EUR für freigeschaltete Geschäftskonten|Mengen, Verfügbarkeit und Versandkosten bestätigen wir im Angebot|So funktioniert es|Anfrage senden – Firmendaten und optional die gewünschten Produkte|Wir prüfen Ihre Unternehmensdaten (ggf. USt-IdNr.)|Wir antworten mit dem nächsten Schritt: Kontofreischaltung, Angebot oder Rückfragen|Sie bestätigen die Bestellung, wir stellen die Rechnung mit korrekt angewandter MwSt. aus|Konditionen im Überblick|Preise|Netto-Großhandelspreisliste in EUR für freigeschaltete Geschäftskunden|Mengen|Hängen vom Produkt ab und werden im Angebot bestätigt|Lieferung|Kosten hängen vom Zielland und den Bestelldetails ab|MwSt. und Rechnung|Hängen von den geltenden Vorschriften und geprüften Transaktionsbedingungen ab|Verfügbarkeit|Wird im Angebot bestätigt|Produkt-Interessenkatalog|Produkte suchen und für ein Angebot auswählen. Hier werden keine Preise angezeigt. Produkt nicht gelistet? Beschreiben Sie es in Ihrer Nachricht.|Produkt oder Marke suchen…|Alle Marken|Zum Angebot|Menge|Keine Produkte gefunden.|Ausgewählte Produkte|Noch keine Produkte ausgewählt.|Entfernen|Alle löschen|B2B-Anfrage|Füllen Sie das kurze Formular aus. Weitere Angaben (z. B. Rechnungsadresse) erfragen wir nur bei Bedarf.|Art der Anfrage|Großhandelskonto beantragen|Großhandelsangebot|Andere Frage|Firmenname|Geschäftliche E-Mail|Land|Land auswählen|Ansprechpartner|Telefon|USt-IdNr. (EU)|Website|Nachricht (auch zu nicht gelisteten Produkten)|Ich habe die|Datenschutzerklärung gelesen.|Ihre Angaben werden zur Beantwortung dieser Anfrage verwendet. Das Absenden ist keine Einwilligung in Werbung.|Anfrage senden|Wird gesendet…|Vielen Dank! Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten und antworten an Ihre E-Mail-Adresse.|Mit * markierte Felder sind Pflichtfelder.|Wählen Sie Produkte aus oder beschreiben Sie Ihren Bedarf.|Einzelhandelspreise gesucht? Besuchen Sie unseren Shop.|Zum Online-Shop|Referenz: JP MART Großhandelspreisliste 30.09.2026. Preise nur für freigeschaltete Geschäftskunden.|Bitte geben Sie eine gültige E-Mail-Adresse ein.|Bitte füllen Sie dieses Feld aus.|Bitte bestätigen, um die Anfrage zu senden.' | split: '|' -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign t = 'Załóż konto B2B|Poproś o wycenę hurtową|Hurt dla firm z Polski i całej UE|Zapraszamy sklepy, apteki, salony, dystrybutorów i importerów z Polski oraz pozostałych krajów UE. Jeden formularz – wybierz, czy chcesz założyć konto, czy poprosić o wycenę.|Marki w naszej ofercie|Dostępność, ceny i ilości potwierdzamy indywidualnie w wycenie.|Jak to działa|Wysyłka z naszego magazynu w Polsce|Obsługujemy firmy w Polsce i w pozostałych krajach UE|Ceny netto w EUR dla zatwierdzonych kont firmowych|Ilości, dostępność i koszt dostawy potwierdzamy w wycenie|Jak to działa|Wyślij zapytanie – dane firmy i, opcjonalnie, wybrane produkty|Weryfikujemy dane firmy (numer VAT UE, jeśli dotyczy)|Odpowiadamy z kolejnym krokiem: zatwierdzenie konta, wycena lub pytania|Potwierdzasz zamówienie, a my wystawiamy fakturę z prawidłowo zastosowanym VAT|Warunki w skrócie|Ceny|Cennik hurtowy netto w EUR dla zatwierdzonych klientów firmowych|Ilości|Zależą od produktu i zostaną potwierdzone w wycenie|Dostawa|Koszt zależy od kraju docelowego i szczegółów zamówienia|VAT i faktura|Zależą od obowiązujących przepisów i zweryfikowanych warunków transakcji|Dostępność|Potwierdzana w wycenie|Katalog produktów do wyceny|Wyszukaj produkty i dodaj te, które chcesz wycenić. Nie pokazujemy tu cen. Produktu nie ma na liście? Opisz go w wiadomości.|Szukaj produktu lub marki…|Wszystkie marki|Dodaj do wyceny|Ilość|Brak produktów.|Wybrane produkty|Nie wybrano jeszcze produktów.|Usuń|Wyczyść|Zapytanie B2B|Wypełnij krótki formularz. Dodatkowe dane (np. adres do faktury) poprosimy podać dopiero, gdy będą potrzebne.|Rodzaj zapytania|Założenie konta hurtowego|Wycena hurtowa|Inne pytanie|Nazwa firmy|Służbowy e-mail|Kraj|Wybierz kraj|Osoba kontaktowa|Telefon|Numer VAT UE|Strona internetowa|Wiadomość (także o produktach spoza listy)|Przeczytałem/am|politykę prywatności.|Dane z formularza posłużą do odpowiedzi na to zapytanie. Wysłanie formularza nie jest zgodą na marketing.|Wyślij zapytanie|Wysyłanie…|Dziękujemy! Otrzymaliśmy Twoje zapytanie i odpowiemy na podany e-mail.|Pola oznaczone * są wymagane.|Wybierz produkty lub opisz, czego potrzebujesz.|Szukasz cen detalicznych? Zajrzyj do naszego sklepu.|Przejdź do sklepu detalicznego|Źródło referencyjne: cennik hurtowy JP MART z 30.09.2026. Ceny tylko dla zatwierdzonych klientów firmowych.|Podaj poprawny adres e-mail.|Uzupełnij to pole.|Zaakceptuj, aby wysłać zapytanie.' | split: '|' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- assign countries = 'Austria|Belgium|Bulgaria|Croatia|Cyprus|Czechia|Denmark|Estonia|Finland|France|Germany|Greece|Hungary|Ireland|Italy|Latvia|Lithuania|Luxembourg|Malta|Netherlands|Poland|Portugal|Romania|Slovakia|Slovenia|Spain|Sweden' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign brand_list = 'Dabur|Vatika|Himalaya|Vicco|Biotique|Hesh|Bajaj|Navratna|Sesa|Medimix|Chandrika|Mysore Sandal|Santoor|Zandu|Samahan (Link Natural)|Organic India|Annam' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign skip_vendors = 'Ocean|Silver Touch' | split: '|' -%}

<div class="jpw" id="b2b-hub">
  <div class="jpw__bar">
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px"><h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">{{ t[2] }}</h2><p style="margin:0">{{ t[3] }}</p></div>
    <a class="jpw-btn" href="#b2b-inquiry" data-type="application" data-jpw-track="apply_click">{{ t[0] }}</a>
    <a class="jpw-btn jpw-btn--ghost" href="#b2b-inquiry" data-type="quote" data-jpw-track="quote_click">{{ t[1] }}</a>
  </div>

  <div class="jpw__sec">
    <h2>{{ t[4] }}</h2>
    <ul class="jpw__brands">{%- for b in brand_list -%}<li>{{ b }}</li>{%- endfor -%}</ul>
    <p class="jpw__src">{{ t[5] }}</p>
    <ul class="jpw__trust"><li>{{ t[7] }}</li><li>{{ t[8] }}</li><li>{{ t[9] }}</li><li>{{ t[10] }}</li></ul>
  </div>

  <div class="jpw__sec">
    <h2>{{ t[11] }}</h2>
    <ol class="jpb-steps jpw__steps"><li>{{ t[12] }}</li><li>{{ t[13] }}</li><li>{{ t[14] }}</li><li>{{ t[15] }}</li></ol>
    <h2>{{ t[16] }}</h2>
    <table class="jpb-table"><tbody>
      <tr><td>{{ t[17] }}</td><td>{{ t[18] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t[19] }}</td><td>{{ t[20] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t[21] }}</td><td>{{ t[22] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t[23] }}</td><td>{{ t[24] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t[25] }}</td><td>{{ t[26] }}</td></tr>
    </tbody></table>
  </div>

  <div class="jpw__sec" id="b2b-catalog">
    <h2>{{ t[27] }}</h2>
    <p>{{ t[28] }}</p>
    <div class="jpw__tools">
      <input type="search" id="jpw-q" placeholder="{{ t[29] }}" aria-label="{{ t[29] }}" enterkeyhint="search">
      <select id="jpw-v" aria-label="{{ t[30] }}"><option value="">{{ t[30] }}</option></select>
    </div>
    <div class="jpw__list" id="jpw-list">
      {%- paginate collections.all.products by 250 -%}
        {%- for p in collections.all.products -%}
          {%- if skip_vendors contains p.vendor or p.title contains 'Zestaw' or p.title contains 'zestaw' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- for v in p.variants -%}
          {%- assign vt = '' -%}{%- unless v.title == 'Default Title' -%}{%- assign vt = v.title -%}{%- endunless -%}
          <div class="jpw__row" data-id="{{ v.id }}" data-t="{{ p.title | downcase | escape }} {{ vt | downcase | escape }} {{ p.vendor | downcase | escape }}" data-v="{{ p.vendor | escape }}" data-name="{{ p.title | escape }}" data-vt="{{ vt | escape }}">
            {%- if p.featured_image and forloop.first -%}<img src="{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56">{%- else -%}<span></span>{%- endif -%}
            <div><b>{{ p.title }}{% if vt != '' %} – {{ vt }}{% endif %}</b><small>{{ p.vendor }}</small></div>
            <label class="jpw__pick"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="{{ t[31] }}: {{ p.title | escape }} {{ vt | escape }}"> {{ t[31] }} <input type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="{{ t[32] }}" aria-label="{{ t[32] }}" disabled></label>
          </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endpaginate -%}
      <p id="jpw-none" hidden style="padding:16px;margin:0">{{ t[33] }}</p>
    </div>
    <p class="jpw__src">{{ t[63] }}</p>
    <div class="jpw__sticky"><a class="jpw-btn" href="#b2b-inquiry" data-type="quote" data-jpw-track="quote_click_catalog">{{ t[1] }} (<span id="jpw-count">0</span>)</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="jpb2b" id="b2b-inquiry">
    <h2 class="jpb2b__title">{{ t[38] }}</h2>
    <p>{{ t[39] }}</p>
    {%- form 'contact', id: 'contact_form', class: 'jpb2b__form' -%}
      <p class="jpb2b__ok" id="jpw-ok" role="status" tabindex="-1" {% unless form.posted_successfully? %}hidden{% endunless %}>✅ {{ t[58] }}</p>
      {%- if form.errors -%}<div class="jpb2b__err" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{%- endif -%}
      <div id="jpw-fields" {% if form.posted_successfully? %}hidden{% endif %}>
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Typ zgłoszenia]" id="jpw-typeh" value="HURT B2B">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" id="jpw-tags" value="lead-new, lead-lang-{{ request.locale.iso_code }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Język strony]" value="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Pipeline]" value="New Inquiry">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Wybrane produkty (wariant, ilość)]" id="jpw-sel" value="">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[UTM]" id="jpw-utm" value="">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Landing / referrer]" id="jpw-ref" value="">
      <div class="jpb2b__hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website2<input type="text" name="contact[Pole kontrolne]" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <div class="jpb2b__grid">
        <label class="jpb2b__full">{{ t[40] }} *
          <select name="contact[Rodzaj zapytania]" id="jpw-type" required>
            <option value="application">{{ t[41] }}</option><option value="quote">{{ t[42] }}</option><option value="general">{{ t[43] }}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>{{ t[44] }} *<input type="text" name="contact[Firma]" required autocomplete="organization"></label>
        <label>{{ t[45] }} *<input type="email" name="contact[email]" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="off"></label>
        <label>{{ t[46] }} *<select name="contact[Kraj]" required autocomplete="country-name"><option value="">{{ t[47] }}</option>{%- for c in countries -%}<option>{{ c }}</option>{%- endfor -%}</select></label>
        <label>{{ t[48] }}<input type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name"></label>
        <label>{{ t[49] }}<input type="tel" name="contact[phone]" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel"></label>
        <label>{{ t[50] }}<input type="text" name="contact[NIP / VAT UE]" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" placeholder="DE123456789"></label>
        <label class="jpb2b__full">{{ t[51] }}<input type="url" name="contact[Strona www]" placeholder="https://" autocomplete="url" inputmode="url"></label>
        <div class="jpb2b__full"><strong>{{ t[34] }}</strong>
          <div class="jpw__sum" id="jpw-sumbox" aria-live="polite" data-empty="{{ t[35] | escape }}" data-remove="{{ t[36] | escape }}">{{ t[35] }}</div>
          <button type="button" class="jpw-link" id="jpw-clear" hidden>{{ t[37] }}</button>
        </div>
        <label class="jpb2b__full">{{ t[52] }}<textarea name="contact[body]" id="jpw-body" rows="3"></textarea></label>
        <label class="jpb2b__check jpb2b__full"><input type="checkbox" name="contact[Informacja o prywatności]" value="TAK" required> <span>{{ t[53] }} <a href="{{ routes.privacy_policy_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t[54] }}</a> {{ t[55] }} *</span></label>
      </div>
      <p class="jpb2b__note">{{ t[59] }}</p>
      <p class="jpb2b__err" id="jpw-pick-err" role="alert" hidden>{{ t[60] }}</p>
      <button type="submit" class="jpb2b__btn" id="jpw-submit" data-sending="{{ t[57] | escape }}">{{ t[56] }}</button>
      </div>
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>

  <div class="jpw__retail">{{ t[61] }} <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ t[62] }}</a></div>
</div>

<style>
  .jpw__steps{margin:12px 0 0}
  .jpw-link{background:none;border:0;padding:6px 0;color:#173f2d;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;min-height:44px}
  .jpw__sum ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:8px}
  .jpw__sum li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .jpw__sum li button{background:none;border:1px solid #d9d2c3;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer;min-height:36px}
  .jpw__sum li input{width:76px;padding:6px;font-size:16px;border:1px solid #d9d2c3;border-radius:8px}
  .jpw__list{max-height:420px}
  .jpw-btn:focus-visible,.jpw-link:focus-visible,.jpw__sum button:focus-visible,.jpb2b__btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c8922f;outline-offset:2px}
  @media(max-width:640px){.jpw__list{max-height:360px}.jpw__bar .jpw-btn{flex:1 1 100%}}
</style>

<script>
(function(){
  var root=document.getElementById('b2b-hub'); if(!root) return;
  var list=document.getElementById('jpw-list'), rows=[].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.jpw__row'));
  var q=document.getElementById('jpw-q'), vs=document.getElementById('jpw-v'), selH=document.getElementById('jpw-sel');
  var box=document.getElementById('jpw-sumbox'), cnt=document.getElementById('jpw-count'), clr=document.getElementById('jpw-clear');
  var type=document.getElementById('jpw-type'), tags=document.getElementById('jpw-tags'), form=document.getElementById('contact_form');
  var KEY='jpw_sel', lang={{ request.locale.iso_code | json }}, sel={};
  try{ sel=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(KEY)||'{}')||{}; }catch(e){ sel={}; }
  var vendors={}; rows.forEach(function(r){vendors[r.dataset.v]=1});
  Object.keys(vendors).sort().forEach(function(v){var o=document.createElement('option');o.value=v;o.textContent=v;vs.appendChild(o)});
  function save(){try{sessionStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(sel))}catch(e){}}
  function label(r){return r.name+(r.vt?' - '+r.vt:'')}
  function render(){
    var ids=Object.keys(sel), lines=[];
    rows.forEach(function(r){var c=r.querySelector('input[type=checkbox]'),n=r.querySelector('input[type=number]'),on=!!sel[r.dataset.id];c.checked=on;n.disabled=!on;n.value=on?sel[r.dataset.id].qty:''});
    box.textContent='';
    if(!ids.length){box.textContent=box.dataset.empty}else{
      var ul=document.createElement('ul');
      ids.forEach(function(id){var s=sel[id],li=document.createElement('li'),sp=document.createElement('span'),inp=document.createElement('input'),b=document.createElement('button');
        sp.textContent=label(s)+' ('+s.vendor+')';inp.type='number';inp.min='1';inp.value=s.qty;inp.setAttribute('inputmode','numeric');inp.setAttribute('aria-label','Qty '+label(s));
        inp.addEventListener('change',function(){s.qty=Math.max(1,parseInt(inp.value,10)||1);save();render()});
        b.type='button';b.textContent=box.dataset.remove;b.setAttribute('aria-label',box.dataset.remove+' '+label(s));b.addEventListener('click',function(){delete sel[id];save();render()});
        var w=document.createElement('span');w.appendChild(inp);w.appendChild(b);li.appendChild(sp);li.appendChild(w);ul.appendChild(li);
        lines.push(label(s)+' ['+s.vendor+'] (variant ID '+id+') x '+s.qty)});
      box.appendChild(ul)}
    selH.value=lines.join('\n');cnt.textContent=ids.length;clr.hidden=!ids.length;save();
  }
  function filter(){var s=q.value.trim().toLowerCase(),v=vs.value,n=0;rows.forEach(function(r){var ok=(!s||r.dataset.t.indexOf(s)>-1)&&(!v||r.dataset.v===v);r.hidden=!ok;if(ok)n++});document.getElementById('jpw-none').hidden=n>0}
  q.addEventListener('input',filter);vs.addEventListener('change',filter);
  list.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest('.jpw__row');if(!r)return;var id=r.dataset.id,c=r.querySelector('input[type=checkbox]'),n=r.querySelector('input[type=number]');
    if(e.target===c){if(c.checked){sel[id]={name:r.dataset.name,vt:r.dataset.vt,vendor:r.dataset.v,qty:1}}else{delete sel[id]}}
    else if(sel[id]){sel[id].qty=Math.max(1,parseInt(n.value,10)||1)}
    render()});
  clr.addEventListener('click',function(){sel={};render()});
  function setType(t){type.value=t;typeChange()}
  function typeChange(){var m={application:'account-application',quote:'quote-request',general:'general-inquiry'};tags.value='lead-new, '+m[type.value]+', lead-lang-'+lang;document.getElementById('jpw-typeh').value='HURT B2B - '+type.value}
  type.addEventListener('change',typeChange);
  root.querySelectorAll('a[data-type]').forEach(function(a){a.addEventListener('click',function(){setType(a.dataset.type);try{if(window.gtag)gtag('event',a.dataset.jpwTrack,{event_category:'wholesale_hub'});if(window.Shopify&&Shopify.analytics&&Shopify.analytics.publish)Shopify.analytics.publish('wholesale_'+a.dataset.jpwTrack,{})}catch(e){}})});
  var T={email:{{ t[64] | json }},req:{{ t[65] | json }},ack:{{ t[66] | json }}};
  form.querySelectorAll('input,select,textarea').forEach(function(el){el.addEventListener('invalid',function(){el.setCustomValidity('');el.setCustomValidity(el.validity.typeMismatch?T.email:(el.type==='checkbox'?T.ack:T.req))});el.addEventListener('input',function(){el.setCustomValidity('')})});
  var sub=document.getElementById('jpw-submit'),sent=false;
  form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
    var b=document.getElementById('jpw-body'),err=document.getElementById('jpw-pick-err');
    if(type.value==='quote'&&!selH.value&&!b.value.trim()){e.preventDefault();err.hidden=false;b.focus();return}
    err.hidden=true;
    if(sent){e.preventDefault();return}
    sent=true;sub.disabled=true;sub.textContent=sub.dataset.sending;
  });
  try{
    var p=new URLSearchParams(location.search),u=[];
    ['utm_source','utm_medium','utm_campaign','utm_term','utm_content','gclid'].forEach(function(k){if(p.get(k))u.push(k+'='+p.get(k))});
    if(u.length)sessionStorage.setItem('jpb2b_utm',u.join('&'));
    if(!sessionStorage.getItem('jpb2b_ref'))sessionStorage.setItem('jpb2b_ref',(document.referrer||'direct')+' | '+location.pathname);
    document.getElementById('jpw-utm').value=sessionStorage.getItem('jpb2b_utm')||'';
    document.getElementById('jpw-ref').value=sessionStorage.getItem('jpb2b_ref')||'';
  }catch(e){}
  var ok=document.getElementById('jpw-ok');
  if(!ok.hidden||/[?&]contact_posted=true/.test(location.search)){
    ok.hidden=false;document.getElementById('jpw-fields').hidden=true;try{sessionStorage.removeItem(KEY)}catch(e){};sel={};
